<title>USA: Unisource names Richard Bogan CFO.</title>
<headline>Unisource names Richard Bogan CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BERWYN, Pa. 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisource Worldwide Inc said Wednesday it named Richard Bogan chief financial officer and senior vice president, effective August 1.</p>
<p>The company said Bogan has spent the last 20 years with Philip Morris companies in various positions and is leaving as Senior Vice President of Finance, Strategy and Information Systems for the Miller Brewing division.</p>
<p>Bogan was named to the Board of Directors of Philip Morris Capital Corp in 1993 and Molson Breweries, Canada, in 1995, Unisource said.</p>
<p>A Unisource Worldwide spokesperson said Bogan is the company's first CFO.</p>
</text>
